  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Fixes upstream Gemini HTTP 400 validation error (`Expected one of either reasoning_effort or custom thinking_config; found both`).\n- Refactors `GeminiProvider` to inherit from `GoogleOpenAIProvider` and utilize `GeminiReasoningEncoder`.\n- Eliminates redundant quirks logic and properly separates reasoning effort from thinking config.\n- Makes launcher preflight error messages dynamic to the invoked tool owner (`mcc-server` vs `fcc-server`).\n- Isolates `test_admin_rtk` test from host environment binaries.\n- Bumps package version to 5.23.4 and passes all 4,130 CI checks.",
