    "message": "fix(gemini): enforce mutually exclusive reasoning effort and thinking config (#137)\n\n- Refactor GeminiProvider to inherit from GoogleOpenAIProvider and use GeminiReasoningEncoder.\n- Eliminate duplicated and conflicting quirks logic that sent both reasoning_effort and extra_body.google.thinking_config.\n- Make launcher preflight error messages dynamic to the invoked tool owner (mcc vs fcc).\n- Isolate test_admin_rtk get test from host PATH.\n- Bump package version to 5.23.4.",
